      "highlight": [
        {
          "kind": "quote",
          "text": "Viewed from here, the shape reveals itself to be a large skull, an effect called anamorphosis which can also be seen in an unusual portrait of Henry’s son Edward VI in the National Portrait Gallery, London.",
          "source": {
            "author": "National Gallery, London",
            "title": "The Ambassadors",
            "readAt": "https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/paintings/hans-holbein-the-younger-the-ambassadors",
